  "semantic_contract": [
    "Every discovered routine body statement is represented in Atlas IR.",
    "Each dialect package owns its profile, classifier, semantic policy, capabilities, normalization rules, and adapter.",
    "Admitted constructs receive database-specific semantic annotations and control-flow structure.",
    "Unsupported extensions are never discarded; they become explicit OPAQUE nodes and findings.",
    "Full body semantics does not mean every future vendor extension is inferred without evidence.",
